---
// /terms/ — Terms of Service.
// Governing law: Latvia.

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description =
  'Terms governing use of ghslabels.com — editorial scope, affiliate relationships, limitation of liability, and applicable law.';
const lastUpdated = '22 May 2026';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Page header -->
  <section class="bg-zinc-900 border-b border-zinc-800">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-4 font-medium">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mb-6 leading-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
        The terms below govern your use of ghslabels.com. By using this site, you agree to these terms.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-6 font-mono">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-0 mb-4">
      1. About these terms
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10">
      These terms govern use of the website ghslabels.com (the &ldquo;site&rdquo;), operated by GHS Labels from Riga, Latvia. By accessing or using the site, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      2. Purpose of the site
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      GHS Labels publishes an independent procurement reference for GHS-compliant chemical labels &mdash; including supplier comparisons, material guides, industry overviews, and buyer&apos;s guides. The site is intended for EHS (environmental, health, and safety) professionals, procurement teams, and others responsible for chemical labelling decisions in a business context.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10">
      We earn affiliate commissions when readers purchase products from suppliers we link to, at no additional cost to the reader. We do not manufacture, fulfil, or ship labels ourselves. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors">Affiliate disclosure</a> for details.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      3. Editorial content is reference, not professional advice
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Content on this site &mdash; including comparisons, supplier profiles, material guides, and industry overviews &mdash; is published for general reference. It is not legal advice, regulatory advice, engineering advice, or substitute for professional consultation specific to your jurisdiction and use case.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10">
      Chemical labelling is regulated under multiple frameworks (CLP in the EU, OSHA HCS in the US, UN GHS, ADR, IMDG, IATA, and others). Regulations change over time. Before making a final labelling decision, consult the original regulation text and, where appropriate, a qualified compliance professional.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      4. Affiliate relationships
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The site contains links to third-party suppliers, including affiliate links. When a reader makes a purchase through an affiliate link, GHS Labels may earn a commission at no additional cost to the reader.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Affiliate links are marked with a dagger symbol (<span class="font-mono text-zinc-100">&dagger;</span>) and pages containing them display an affiliate disclosure banner. Editorial recommendations are not determined by commission rates &mdash; see our
      <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
      for the full policy.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10">
      We are not the seller of any product reached via an affiliate link. The terms of sale, warranty, return policy, and customer support are governed by the relevant supplier.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      5. User submissions
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      When you submit a contact form or email subscription, you confirm that the information provided is accurate and that you have the authority to provide it. Submissions are processed in accordance with our
      <a href="/privacy/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10">
      We reserve the right to decline to respond to any submission, including those that appear to be automated, abusive, or not made in good faith.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      6. Intellectual property
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      All editorial content on the site &mdash; including articles, comparisons, guides, original graphics, and the GHS Labels name and logo &mdash; is the intellectual property of GHS Labels unless otherwise attributed. You may quote short extracts for non-commercial purposes with attribution and a link to the source page.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10">
      Supplier logos, product images, and trademarks shown on the site are the property of their respective owners and are used for identification and editorial commentary purposes. Use of such marks does not imply endorsement by the trademark owner.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      7. No warranty
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10">
      The site is provided on an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; basis. We take reasonable care to ensure information is accurate at the time of publication, but we do not warrant that the site or its content is error-free, complete, current, or fit for any particular purpose. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, we disclaim all implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      8. Limitation of liability
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10">
      To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, GHS Labels and its operators will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising out of or in connection with use of the site, including loss of profits, business interruption, or loss of data, even if advised of the possibility of such damages. In all cases our aggregate liability is limited to one hundred euros (EUR 100) or the total fees you have paid us in the preceding twelve months, whichever is higher.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      9. Third-party links
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10">
      The site links to third-party websites operated by suppliers, regulators, and other parties. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content, accuracy, or practices. A link does not constitute endorsement of the linked site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      10. Changes to these terms
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10">
      We may update these terms when our services or applicable laws change. The &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Material changes will be highlighted via a notice on the site. Continued use of the site after a revision constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      11. Governing law and jurisdiction
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10">
      These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Latvia. Any dispute arising out of or in connection with these terms or use of the site will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Latvia, without prejudice to consumer rights you may have under the law of your habitual residence within the European Union.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 mt-12 mb-4">
      12. Contact
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      For questions about these terms, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:sergejssevcenko@ghslabels.com" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors">sergejssevcenko@ghslabels.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 italic mt-10">
      These terms of service were last updated on {lastUpdated}.
    </p>

  </article>
</Layout>
